msgid ""
"<b>Font family</b>"
"<p>A font family is a group of fonts that resemble one another, with family "
"members that are e.g. bold, italic, or any number of the above.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Yazu ğäiläse</b>"
"<p>Adı ber bulıp, küreneşe ayırılğan yazular törkeme yazula ğäiläse itep atala, "
"anda awış, qalın, yä quşma-üzençälekle yazular bula ala.</p>"

